# Rheos kanban event ledger: a live, high-churn, append-only event log
# written continuously by rheos.service as the board is used. Tracking it
# put it in the blast radius of any full-tree `git stash`/`git stash pop` —
# a stash taken while the service concurrently writes here can silently
# clobber newer live writes on pop (this happened on 2026-07-21: several
# cards' review dispositions were reverted this way, recovered by hand).
# The story .md files under docs/kanban/stories/ stay tracked -- they're
# real card content, not a log -- only the ledger is excluded.
docs/kanban/.events/ledger.edn

# Heretic mutation pilot working dirs
.heretic/
.heretic-sandbox/
